      "refersTo": "nav-rail",
      "description": "Navy rail with water call to action and two-line items.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-rail\"><a class=\"ds-cta\" href=\"#\">+ Analizuj nową inwestycję</a><div class=\"ds-gl\">Baza doświadczeń</div><a class=\"ds-ni ds-active\" href=\"#\"><b>Start</b><span>wnioski z całej bazy</span></a><a class=\"ds-ni\" href=\"#\"><b>Baza przypadków</b><span>projekty, umowy, zmiany</span></a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-rail{background:#0B2A45;color:#C7D6E4;width:272px;padding:16px 10px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;font-family:\"Barlow\",system-ui,sans-serif;}.ds-cta{display:block;margin:0 4px 16px;padding:12px 14px;border-radius:10px;background:#1668A8;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:15px;text-decoration:none;transition:background .2s,transform .2s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1)}.ds-cta:hover{background:#1F7FC4;transform:translateY(-1px)}.ds-gl{font-family:\"Barlow Semi Condensed\",\"Barlow\",system-ui,sans-serif;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;font-weight:700;font-size:11.5px;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7F98B0;padding:10px 10px 8px}.ds-ni{display:flex;flex-direction:column;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:9px;color:#C7D6E4;text-decoration:none;transition:background .2s}.ds-ni b{font-size:15px;font-weight:600}.ds-ni span{font-size:12.5px;color:#8FA8BF}.ds-ni:hover{background:#123A5D;color:#fff}.ds-active{background:#1A4C77;color:#fff}.ds-ni:focus-visible,.ds-cta:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #5FB3EA;outline-offset:2px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Gauge Staff",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "gauge-panel",
      "description": "Signature wodowskaz: E-block face, water settled at P80, P50/P80/P90 marks.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-gauges\"><div class=\"ds-gt\">Rezerwa kosztowa</div><svg viewBox=\"0 0 168 200\" width=\"150\"><rect x=\"6\" y=\"6\" width=\"45\" height=\"188\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#123A5D\"/><rect x=\"12\" y=\"6\" width=\"33\" height=\"188\" fill=\"#F4F8FB\"/><g fill=\"#0B2A45\"><rect x=\"13\" y=\"156\" width=\"3.5\" height=\"38\"/><rect x=\"13\" y=\"156\" width=\"15\" height=\"7.6\"/><rect x=\"13\" y=\"171\" width=\"15\" height=\"7.6\"/><rect x=\"13\" y=\"186\" width=\"15\" height=\"7.6\"/><rect x=\"29\" y=\"118\" width=\"3.5\" height=\"38\"/><rect x=\"29\" y=\"118\" width=\"15\" height=\"7.6\"/><rect x=\"29\" y=\"133\" width=\"15\" height=\"7.6\"/><rect x=\"29\" y=\"148\" width=\"15\" height=\"7.6\"/></g><path class=\"ds-wl\" d=\"M6 70 q10 -5 20 0 t20 0 t10 0 V194 H6 Z\" fill=\"#2E8FD6\" fill-opacity=\".78\"/><line x1=\"6\" x2=\"58\" y1=\"110\" y2=\"110\" stroke=\"#F4C20D\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"62\" y=\"114\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#fff\">P50 +12%</text><line x1=\"6\" x2=\"58\" y1=\"70\" y2=\"70\" stroke=\"#FF5A5F\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"62\" y=\"74\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#fff\">P80 +31%</text><line x1=\"6\" x2=\"58\" y1=\"44\" y2=\"44\" stroke=\"#FFB3B6\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\"/><text x=\"62\" y=\"48\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#fff\">P90</text></svg><div class=\"ds-gv\">+31%</div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-gauges{display:inline-block;background:#0B2A45;border-radius:14px;padding:18px;color:#DDE8F2}.ds-gt{font-family:\"Barlow Semi Condensed\",\"Barlow\",system-ui,sans-serif;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;font-weight:700;font-size:17px;color:#fff;margin-bottom:8px}.ds-gv{font-family:\"Barlow Semi Condensed\",\"Barlow\",system-ui,sans-serif;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;font-weight:800;font-size:30px;line-height:1;color:#fff;margin-top:6px}.ds-wl{animation:ds-fill 1.6s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1) both}@keyframes ds-fill{from{transform:translateY(130px)}to{transform:none}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-wl{animation:none}}"
